31
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,720
Hello? Detective Chen

32
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,540
I've heard so much about you

33
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:58,900
I'd like to ask you to help me find

34
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,240
a sixteen-year-old miracle doctor

35
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:03,520
A miracle doctor?

36
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,280
I'm sorry

37
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:09,080
I won't take this case

38
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,280
Fine, don't take it

39
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,420
Your little nephew is now in my hands

40
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:14,700
If you insist on not showing up, huh?

41
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:17,740
Uncle!

42
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:18,560
Locky!

43
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,520
We're fine

44
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,600
Don't worry

45
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,920
Ah, Uncle

46
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:18,360
Uncle, you're so lame!

47
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,139
Coming to a fancy villa banquet

48
00:04:20,139 --> 00:04:21,680
dressed like that?

49
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:26,420
Huh? How did you get here too?

50
00:04:26,420 --> 00:04:29,840
Some people are just low-class

51
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:32,639
Nothing's as elegant as me.

52
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:44,039
Welcome, everyone.

53
00:04:44,039 --> 00:04:46,079
I'm the master here.

54
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,800
Goldsworth.

55
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:50,819
What a terrible name!

56
00:04:50,819 --> 00:04:51,360
Poison Castle. Poison Castle.

57
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:54,759
Who are you, really?

58
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:56,399
Show yourself, now.

59
00:04:56,399 --> 00:05:02,219
I invited you all here to ask you to find a doctor for me.

60
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:06,220
So you're looking for a doctor.

61
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:08,220
That's easy.

62
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:13,220
I can send my former men to find him for you.

63
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:15,220
There, there, off you go.

64
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:25,220
I'm sure you've all heard of

65
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:27,220
Miracle Doctor Yunfeng, right?

66
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:31,220
Locky, let's go.

67
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:34,220
Great detective.

68
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:38,220
Did you think my Golden Poison Castle was just a scary name?

69
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:41,220
The reason I don't show myself

70
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:44,220
is because the whole hall is already filled with the poison flowers on the tables

71
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:46,220
and the toxins they give off.

72
00:05:46,220 --> 00:06:02,440
You're already poisoned.

73
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,640
In this world,

74
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:06,940
Only Miracle Doctor Yunfeng can give you the antidote.

75
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:10,100
I hope you find him soon.

76
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:12,620
Good luck, everyone.

77
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:15,500
Uncle——

78
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:19,500
The poison's acting up.

79
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:21,500
Looks like I'm done for.

80
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:25,500
Buy me a Magic Horn Detective toy.

81
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:32,500
Uncle, wait for me!

82
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:35,500
Locky, wait for me!

83
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:42,500
Are you sure these kids who look like they're not too bright

84
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,500
will really find Yunfeng?

85
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:49,339
Don't worry. Just wait for them to bring back that miracle doctor.

86
00:06:49,339 --> 00:06:52,699
And to think I treated him well back then.

87
00:06:52,699 --> 00:06:54,779
But he stole the Colitas flower seeds

88
00:06:54,779 --> 00:06:55,800
I used to make banned drugs.

89
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,560
But...

90
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:01,000
Why exactly are you helping me find Yunfeng?

91
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:04,040
For Love!

92
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,839
For Ideals!

93
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:29,600
Uncle, it looks like nobody's lived here for a long time.

94
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,220
Uncle, this place is a real mess.

95
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:54,700
Detective Chen.

96
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:57,040
I checked Yunfeng's records.

97
00:07:57,040 --> 00:08:01,379
So many awards!

98
00:08:01,379 --> 00:08:06,140
The once world-famous miracle doctor Yunfeng

99
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:08,540
was ruined by helping Goldsworth Pharmaceuticals

100
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:10,360
develop those banned drugs.

101
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:13,220
And in the end, the government revoked his medical license.

102
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:15,100
Not long after that,

103
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:17,640
Yunfeng suddenly and mysteriously disappeared.

104
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,960
Oh? Hmm...

105
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,040
Huh? Uncle's in this photo!

106
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,040
Huh?

107
00:08:33,539 --> 00:08:37,039
The one on the far left must be Miracle Doctor Yunfeng.

108
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:43,039
But Uncle, how come you're in the photo too?

109
00:08:51,539 --> 00:08:54,039
This time Goldsworth is looking for Yunfeng,

110
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:56,799
probably to develop new banned drugs again.

111
00:08:56,799 --> 00:09:00,799
We have to find Yunfeng before Goldsworth does.

112
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:04,279
So, Detective Jimmy,

113
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:08,480
please, you must tell me all the intel you have.

114
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,839
Tell us! Tell us! Tell us!

115
00:09:10,839 --> 00:09:12,519
Tell me, tell me! Come on, Uncle!

116
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:15,659
Fine, fine! I really can't hide anything from you guys.

117
00:09:20,379 --> 00:09:23,279
Yunfeng is a friend I grew up with.

118
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:25,759
Later I became a detective,

119
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:29,039
while he inherited his father's clinic.

120
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:34,559
Then who's that pretty lady next to him?

121
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:36,019
Her name is Su Wu.

122
00:09:36,019 --> 00:09:37,019
[Ending Theme]

123
00:09:47,019 --> 00:09:50,419
All alone, lonely and forlorn,

124
00:09:50,419 --> 00:09:53,879
At times like this in life,

125
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:58,360
There's bound to be some unhappiness.

126
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:01,479
Saying goodbye to today

127
00:10:01,479 --> 00:10:05,879
Always leaves you feeling lost

128
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:09,319
Look at tomorrow

129
00:10:09,319 --> 00:10:13,679
Waving to me from your horizon

130
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:17,339
Every day is just the sun rising and setting

131
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:21,340
Turning into time, dreaming more and more

132
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:26,379
Expecting every second and moment in life

133
00:10:26,379 --> 00:10:33,100
Bright eyes are twinkling

134
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:36,480
Smiles that face the sun

135
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:41,680
Trampling the bridge at the dim intersection

136
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,340
Isn't that so

137
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:55,340
Aunt Su Wu

138
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:58,840
Little one

139
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,340
Do you know him?